{"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Traversal\/documentation\/Traversal\/EdgeDepthFirstSearchEvent\/backEdge(_:)","doc:\/\/Traversal\/documentation\/Traversal\/EdgeDepthFirstSearchEvent\/crossEdge(_:)","doc:\/\/Traversal\/documentation\/Traversal\/EdgeDepthFirstSearchEvent\/discover(_:)","doc:\/\/Traversal\/documentation\/Traversal\/EdgeDepthFirstSearchEvent\/finish(_:)","doc:\/\/Traversal\/documentation\/Traversal\/EdgeDepthFirstSearchEvent\/forwardEdge(_:)","doc:\/\/Traversal\/documentation\/Traversal\/EdgeDepthFirstSearchEvent\/treeEdge(_:)"],"title":"Enumeration Cases","generated":true,"anchor":"Enumeration-Cases"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Traversal\/documentation\/Traversal\/EdgeDepthFirstSearchEvent\/CustomStringConvertible-Implementations","doc:\/\/Traversal\/documentation\/Traversal\/EdgeDepthFirstSearchEvent\/Equatable-Implementations"],"title":"Default Implementations","generated":true,"anchor":"Default-Implementations"}],"relationshipsSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Traversal\/s8CopyableP","doc:\/\/Traversal\/s23CustomStringConvertibleP","doc:\/\/Traversal\/SQ","doc:\/\/Traversal\/s9EscapableP","doc:\/\/Traversal\/SH","doc:\/\/Traversal\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/Traversal\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"type":"conformsTo","title":"Conforms To","kind":"relationships"}],"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"@frozen","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"EdgeDepthFirstSearchEvent","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Vertex","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Edge","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":"> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"where","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Vertex","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SH","text":"Hashable","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Edge","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SH","text":"Hashable","kind":"typeIdentifier"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"overview","text":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A vertex is discovered, then its out-edges are reported, then it is finished. An edge to an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"undiscovered vertex is a tree edge, and the search continues from that vertex before the next"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"edge. An edge to a vertex discovered but not yet finished is a back edge; a self-loop is one."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"An edge to a finished vertex is a forward edge when that vertex was discovered later than the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"vertex being explored, and a cross edge otherwise."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In a directed graph every out-edge of an explored vertex is reported. In an undirected graph"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"each edge is reported once, from the end that reaches it first: the tree edge is not"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reported again from the vertex it discovered, but a parallel edge to the parent is a back edge,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and a self-loop is one back edge. Without pruning or a depth limit an undirected search has"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"only tree and back edges; an edge to a finished vertex whose edges were not explored is a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"forward or cross edge."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"metadata":{"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"EdgeDepthFirstSearchEvent","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"Traversal"}],"title":"EdgeDepthFirstSearchEvent","externalID":"s:9Traversal25EdgeDepthFirstSearchEventO","fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"EdgeDepthFirstSearchEvent","kind":"identifier"}],"symbolKind":"enum","roleHeading":"Enumeration"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Traversal\/documentation\/Traversal"]]},"sections":[],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"What an edge depth-first search reports, in order: the events of "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"DepthFirstSearchEvent"},{"type":"text","text":", with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"each edge given by its position in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"edges"},{"type":"text","text":", so parallel edges are told apart."}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Traversal\/documentation\/Traversal\/EdgeDepthFirstSearchEvent"},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/traversal\/edgedepthfirstsearchevent"]}],"references":{"doc://Traversal/s16SendableMetatypeP":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Traversal\/s16SendableMetatypeP","type":"unresolvable","title":"Swift.SendableMetatype"},"doc://Traversal/SH":{"title":"Swift.Hashable","identifier":"doc:\/\/Traversal\/SH","type":"unresolvable"},"doc://Traversal/documentation/Traversal/EdgeDepthFirstSearchEvent/Equatable-Implementations":{"abstract":[],"kind":"article","type":"topic","title":"Equatable Implementations","identifier":"doc:\/\/Traversal\/documentation\/Traversal\/EdgeDepthFirstSearchEvent\/Equatable-Implementations","url":"\/documentation\/traversal\/edgedepthfirstsearchevent\/equatable-implementations","role":"collectionGroup"},"doc://Traversal/documentation/Traversal/EdgeDepthFirstSearchEvent":{"url":"\/documentation\/traversal\/edgedepthfirstsearchevent","kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"EdgeDepthFirstSearchEvent","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/Traversal\/documentation\/Traversal\/EdgeDepthFirstSearchEvent","abstract":[{"text":"What an edge depth-first search reports, in order: the e